{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 17, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun a journey most grand I shall devise for thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive in Tokyo's embrace. Narita's gate shall yield thee to this vibrant space. A swift train ride to Shinjuku's heights you'll climb. Behold the city's glow a spectacle sublime. A humble inn shall be thy nightly keep. Prepare thyself for wonders both shallow and deep.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Temples and Modern Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall make haste. Senso-ji's grandeur a sight to taste. Then onward to Shibuya a bustling scene. Where youthful spirits dance ever keen.  Harajuku's fashion a wondrous show.  Observe the trends as they ebb and flow.  Ginza's elegance a shopper's delight.  Indulge thy senses with all thy might.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Kiss**\n\nA journey to Hakone a mountain's steep.  Lake Ashi's waters secrets to keep.  Cruise the lake admire Mount Fuji's form.  A painter's dream weathering every storm.  The Hakone Open-Air Museum art doth reside.  Nature and sculpture side by side.  Return to Tokyo ere evening descends.  A weary traveler's journey now ends.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Majesty**\n\nBy bullet train we'll swiftly depart. To Kyoto's heart a work of art.  Fushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream. Thousands of torii a vibrant gleam. Kiyomizu-dera's temple a wooden grace.  Panoramic views of this sacred place. Gion's geishas a fleeting sight.  Enchanting figures bathed in pale moonlight.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Gardens and Golden Pavilion**\n\nRyoan-ji's garden a puzzling art. Fifteen stones arranged a mindful start. Kinkaku-ji's pavilion gold doth shine. Reflecting beauty a truly divine. Arashiyama's bamboo grove so tall.  Whispering secrets answering nature's call.  Nijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's keep.  History's echoes slumbering deep.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey with joyful stride. Where friendly deer freely roam and abide. Todai-ji's temple houses Buddha's grace. A colossal statue in this hallowed place. Kasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow.  A mystical aura a gentle flow. Return to Kyoto as day doth wane.  Reflecting on wonders again and again.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure from Japan**\n\nFarewell Japan thy beauty I embrace.  Memories forged in this wondrous place.  To Narita's gate we bid thee adieu.  A journey concluded forever true.  May thy spirit linger in my heart.  Until we meet again a brand new start.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.6910643577575684}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.07012706995010376}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.21430380642414093}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.7915206551551819}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.2969047725200653}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.3752225339412689}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.1181805357336998}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.08525600284337997}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.03721204772591591}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.13157081604003906}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.005201260559260845}, {"token": "▁devise", "logprob": -1.1943621635437012}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.018169978633522987}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.003574887989088893}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.04170996695756912}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0025031205732375383}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -1.1324817933200393e-05}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.004246029071509838}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.9265139698982239}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.2492462396621704}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.000369838031474500